# Clinical Indication Detail Pages

Every clinical application subtype page must reuse the Same-Day Crown chrome. **Only content and images change.**

## Shell (required)

- Root: `cl cl--sdc` via `ClinicalIndicationPage`
- CSS: `@/app/odyx-clinical.css` — do not fork per-indication stylesheets
- Font: Inter only (`var(--font-inter)`) — never Sora/Tajawal on detail pages
- Type scale: only `--sdc-*` tokens — no per-page font-size inventing
- Accent CTAs / timeline / tips / why icons: `#0050D8` (`--cl-blue`)
- Badge: category accent via `--cl-badge` (restorative `#8153CF`, implant `#5480EB`, orthodontics `#56B1A3`, prosthetics `#ED9E5E`, cases `#D65765`)
- Footer: routes under `/solutions/clinical-applications` use `Hv2Footer`

## Fixed section order

1. Hero `[data-hero-dark]` — transparent PNG cutout, no card chrome
2. Products (5 cards)
3. Workflow Timeline (5 photo-circle steps; title left-aligned with Scan)
4. Before & After + Why ODYX?
5. Printing Parameters + Clinical Tips + Real Case

## UI rules

- Tips: **square checkboxes** only (`TipCheck`) — never circular/radio marks
- Timeline icons: circular photo assets, not low-res line icons
- Hero image: true alpha PNG; subject matches indication
- Why icons: blue outline line-art mapped by `why.items[].id`
- Content shape: `ClinicalIndicationContent` in the indications registry

## Assets

Per slug under `public/img/clinical/{slug}/`:

- `hero-cutout.png` — transparent background
- `tl/tl-*.png` — circular workflow icons
- Before/after and case thumbs indication-specific

## Clinical Cases column (hub)

- Hub **Clinical Cases** items link to **category listing** pages (`restorative-cases`, `implant-cases`, `ortho-cases`, `prosthetic-cases`) via `ClinicalCasesListingPage`
- Listings aggregate indication heroes from that category and link to detail workflows
- Do **not** render case listings with the full Same-Day Crown section stack

## Do not

- Point multiple hub items at Same-Day Crown as a placeholder
- Reuse crown hero/timeline finish art on unrelated indications
- Change layout classes, type tokens, or brand blue for accents
- Missing `tl-scan` / `tl-print` / `tl-cure` in `public/img/clinical/{slug}/tl/` (always ship all five icons)
